notes.content:
Dear Heartbeat Guardians

Hello everyone! Their first update of Charming Hearts will be officially released at[b] 12:00 Beijing time on June 26th.[/b]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45021452/77bb80febe9ad846c045ebf3883717cde27818d2.png[/img]
Here are the updated content：

1. Fixed the issue of some plot segments getting stuck in rare cases and subsequent plot jumps becoming disorganized;
2. Fixed the issue where clicking to play the latest chapter storyline occasionally mistakenly played other segments after backtracking the plot after opening a new chapter;
3. Optimized the favorability threshold of the plot in chapters 5 and 6, and improved the fault tolerance rate of passing the level;
4. Optimized the transition of some plot chapters;
5. Multiple language versions have been added, which can be set in the game's main function menu. Currently, only English switching is supported;
6. The game has an open download function for built-in picture albums.

Thank you for your understanding and support.



Wish you can have a long and fulfilling love.

Charming Hearts Develop Team
